kable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[0,0][1440,3120]" drawing-order="0" hint=""><node index="0" text="" resource-id="" class="android.widget.ScrollView" package="cn.nanoturtle.rootmys9280" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="true" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[0,129][1440,2640]" drawing-order="0" hint=""><node index="0" text="" resource-id="" class="android.view.View" package="cn.nanoturtle.rootmys9280" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[60,129][1380,2041]" drawing-order="0" hint=""><node index="0" text="A: 正常。exploit 通过破坏内核内存提权，命中关键结构就会 oops 重启。官方参考实现同样需要多次尝试（S928U1 验证时第 2 轮 attempt 4/24 才成功）。失败/重启后重新运行即可。" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="cn.nanoturtle.rootmys9280" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[120,129][1320,193]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node index="1" text="Q: 每次重启后都要重新 Root 吗？" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="cn.nanoturtle.rootmys9280" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[120,231][794,297]" drawing-order="1" hint="" /><node index="2" text="A: 是。bootloader 是锁定的，无法持久化写入内核模块。每次重启后运行一次“开始 Root”，再强制停止并重开 KernelSU Manager 即可。" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="cn.nanoturtle.rootmys9280" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[120,305][1320,491]" drawing-order="2" hint="" /><node index="3" text="Q: 运行期间为什么要熄屏？" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="cn.nanoturtle.rootmys9280" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[120,529][669,595]" drawing-order="3" hint="" /><node index="4" text="A: 屏幕刷新会产生显示驱动 work，可能与 exploit 注入的内核 work 竞争，是概率性崩溃的最大来源。熄屏后显示驱动停止，成功率显著提高。" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="cn.nanoturtle.rootmys9280" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[120,603][1320,789]" drawing-order="4" hint="" /><node index="5" text="Q: KernelSU Manager 显示“未安装”怎么办？" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="cn.nanoturtle.rootmys9280" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[120,827][1032,893]" drawing-order="5" hint="" /><node index="6" text="A: 驱动已加载但 Manager 首次检测可能失败。强制停止 Manager 后重新打开，应显示“工作中 &lt;LKM&gt; [越狱模式]”。" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="cn.nanoturtle.rootmys9280" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[120,901][1320,1027]" drawing-order="6" hint="" /><node index="7" text="Q: 这个方案会熔断 KNOX 吗？" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="cn.nanoturtle.rootmys9280" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[120,1065][732,1131]" drawing-order="7" hint="" /><node index="8" text="A: 不会。本方案通过内核漏洞（CVE-2026-43499）免解锁提权，不刷 bootloader，KNOX e-fuse 状态保持原样（设置页可查看本机状态）。仅当设备之前已经解锁熔断（0x1）时无法恢复；Secure Folder 等 KNOX 功能在 root 后需用 KnoxPatch 恢复，与本方案是否熔断无关。" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="cn.nanoturtle.rootmys9280" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[120,1139][1320,1445]" drawing-order="8" hint="" /><node index="9" text="Q: KnoxPatch / Secure Folder 怎么用？" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="cn.nanoturtle.rootmys9280" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[120,1483][941,1549]" drawing-order="9" hint="" /><node index="10" text="A: 在 KernelSU Manager 安装 Zygisk-Next 和 LSPosed 模块，安装 KnoxPatch APK，在 LSPosed 里启用后重启 Zygote，打开 KnoxPatch 勾选 Secure Folder 即可。" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="cn.nanoturtle.rootmys9280" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[120,1557][1320,1743]" drawing-order="10" hint="" /><node index="11" text="Q: 卸载/恢复原样？" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="cn.nanoturtle.rootmys9280" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[120,1781][509,1847]" drawing-order="11" hint="" /><node index="12" text="A: 无需卸载——重启手机即恢复原状（模块文件保留在 /data/adb，不影响正常使用）。" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="cn.nanoturtle.rootmys9280" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[120,1855][1320,1981]" drawing-order="12" hint="" /></node><node index="1" text="源代码与许可公示" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="cn.nanoturtle.rootmys9280" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[60,2086][523,2176]" drawing-order="1" hint="" /><node index="2" text="" resource-id="" class="android.view.View" package="cn.nanoturtle.rootmys9280" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[60,2206][1380,2640]" drawing-order="2" hint=""><node index="0" text="RootMyS9280（本项目）" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="cn.nanoturtle.rootmys9280" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[120,2266][647,2332]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node index="1" text="基于 CVE-2026-43499 安全研究适配 SM-S9280 (国行 DZF2)：修正 kmalloc_caches、S928 常量、竞态修复等。本项目源码发布后将在设置页更新地址。" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="cn.nanoturtle.rootmys9280" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[120,2340][1320,2526]" drawing-order="1" hint="" /><node index="2" text="CVE-2026-43499 研究" resource-id="" class="android.w